                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>وَاعْلَمُوْا أَنِّمَا غَنِمْتُمْ مِّنْ شَئٍ فَأَنِّ لِلهِ خُمُسَهُ وَلِلْرِّسُوْلِ &lt;&lt; &gt;&gt; ولِذِيْ القُرْبَيْ وَاليَتَميْ وَالمَسَاكِيْنَ وَابْنِ السِّبِيْلِ<note>Delition.
šaddas on the top of the fatḥas.</note>
                     </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#17v">-17v</locus>وَطَبَعَ اللهُ عَلَيْ قُلُوْبِهِمْ فَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُوْنَ</explicit>
                     <note>8:41-9:93. Ihmāl marks on rā's. Elaborated execution of lām/lā; extension of bā' (5v). 12 lines a page. Rubricated title of suras. Several words completed the following line. A lot of words were started on a line, and were entirely rewritten the following line. Deletions, and corrections.</note>
